[1m[38;5;231mWhich tooling should we set up from the start?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [ ] [38;5;153mLint + auto-format[39m
  [38;5;246mESLint + Prettier, aggressive config. Cheapest now, annoying to retrofit across a grown codebase.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m [ ] Unit test infrastructure
  [38;5;246mVitest + a first passing fixture. Strongly recommended — the engine core is where this project's risk lives.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m [ ] End-to-end tests
  [38;5;246mPlaywright over the real page. Catches wiring and UI bugs the unit tests structurally cannot.[39m
  [38;5;246m4.[39m [ ] Fuzz / property testing
  [38;5;246mfast-check over the scheduler — random task/time sequences asserting no duplicate and no missed events.[39m
